translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_72bdf94b:

    # "Marbella began to explain the history of the origins of the dwarven and goblin alliance."
    "A Marbella começou a explicar a história das origens da aliança entre anões e goblins."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:526
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_26510386:

    # "In the beginning, both sides continued to war in the mines of Iryiad over the precious rocks and materials down there."
    "No início, ambos os lados continuaram a guerrear nas minas de Iryiad pelas rochas e materiais preciosos que lá existiam."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:527
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_b389259c:

    # "For centuries, both sides engaged in brutal, tit-for-tat warfare, often under the mountains themselves."
    "Durante séculos, ambos os lados travaram uma guerra brutal de olho por olho, muitas vezes debaixo das próprias montanhas."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:528
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_75114474:

    # "King Zorvul Glimmerfang of the goblins was ever a match for King Bramdur Forgeworth, the great dwarven king."
    "O Rei Zorvul Presa Cintilante dos goblins foi sempre um adversário à altura do Rei Bramdur Forja Digna, o grande rei dos anões."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:529
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_6aed5751:

    # "By pure happenstance, Mirgwen Glimmerfang, the goblin princess, and Prince Dorric Forgeworth, heir to the dwarven kingdom, were both reluctantly seeking suitors for marriage."
    "Por puro acaso, Mirgwen Presa Cintilante, a princesa goblin, e o Príncipe Dorric Forgeworth, herdeiro do reino anão, estavam ambos relutantemente à procura de pretendentes para casamento."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:530
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_86f3ccdb:

    # "Of course, these marriages were arranged by their fathers, and neither side was supposed to ever meet..."
    "Claro, estes casamentos foram arranjados pelos pais, e nenhum dos lados deveria alguma vez encontrar-se..."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:531
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_995db5c5:

    # "By chance, during a terrible storm, the crows delivering the letters to their suitors became confused."
    "Por acaso, durante uma terrível tempestade, os corvos que entregavam as cartas aos seus pretendentes ficaram confusos."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:532
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_79c0b419:

    # "By accident, Mirgwen and Dorric's letters were wrongly delivered to each other."
    "Por acidente, as cartas de Mirgwen e Dorric foram entregues trocadas um ao outro."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:533
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_5246466f:

    # "The two, perhaps amused at how different their personalities were,"
    "Os dois, talvez divertidos com o quão diferentes as suas personalidades eram,"

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:534
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_f3c493f0:

    # "Dorric being a poetic romantic and Mirgwen famous for her wit and occasional crudeness, continued to write to each other, unaware of exactly who they were writing to, with both simply marking their names as 'D' and 'M' respectively."
    "Sendo Dorric um romântico poético e Mirgwen famosa pela sua sagacidade e ocasional crueza, continuaram a escrever-se, sem saber exatamente a quem escreviam, com ambos simplesmente a assinar os seus nomes como 'D' e 'M' respetivamente."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:535
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_2787f072:

    # "The two agreed to meet in secret. Mirgwen, expecting to meet another goblin warlord, and Dorric, believing he was speaking to Lady Margott, a noble dwarven lady friendly with the family."
    "Os dois combinaram encontrar-se em segredo. Mirgwen, esperando encontrar outro senhor da guerra goblin, e Dorric, acreditando que falava com a Senhora Margott, uma nobre dama anã amiga da família."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:536
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_348f7fff:

    # "Mirgwen bathed naked in the hot spring waters, only to be found much earlier than expected by Dorric."
    "Mirgwen banhou-se nua nas águas termais, apenas para ser encontrada muito mais cedo do que o esperado por Dorric."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:537
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_a046beee:

    # "The two drew weapons, but quickly realized who the other person was."
    "Os dois sacaram das armas, mas rapidamente perceberam quem era a outra pessoa."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:538
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_011e811b:

    # "After some brief confusion, the two left and continued to write to each other. Dorric was completely overtaken by Mirgwen's beauty, not realizing goblins could look like that."
    "Após alguma confusão breve, os dois partiram e continuaram a escrever um ao outro. Dorric ficou completamente rendido pela beleza de Mirgwen, sem perceber que os goblins podiam ter aquele aspeto."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:539
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_b193dc63:

    # "Eventually, the two fell in love, and triggered a crisis by openly announcing their engagement."
    "Com o tempo, os dois apaixonaram-se, e desencadearam uma crise ao anunciar abertamente o seu noivado."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:540
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_21f80159:

    # "On the verge of the war becoming even more violent, Dorric and Mirgwen pleaded with their fathers to meet, threatening to leave Iryiad if they did not."
    "À beira da guerra se tornar ainda mais violenta, Dorric e Mirgwen suplicaram aos pais que se encontrassem, ameaçando deixar Iryiad se não o fizessem."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:541
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_765ba0c8:

    # "Reluctantly, both sides met, and to their surprise, King Zorvul and Bramdur got along remarkably well."
    "Relutantemente, ambos os lados encontraram-se, e para surpresa deles, o Rei Zorvul e Bramdur deram-se notavelmente bem."

# game/data/world_romance/marbella/rom_marbella_love.rpy:542
translate ptPT rom_marbella_love_return_after_date_469707ca:

